# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout, regardless of
# platform or a contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. This repo is
# developed on Linux (Astro/Node build, Cloudflare Pages deploy); forcing LF
# avoids CRLF drift when the working tree is copied or cloned across OSes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary assets: never touch line endings, never text-diff.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
